      <section id="faq" class="page-top">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h1>Questions we hear</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>How do we get started?</summary>
            <p>With the complimentary 1-week Cloud Assessment Sprint. We look at one subscription or priority workload with read-only access and give you an executive readout, quick wins and a recommended next step.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What does the complimentary assessment cost or commit us to?</summary>
            <p>Nothing. There is no fee and no obligation to continue.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How is a paid sprint priced?</summary>
            <p>Each paid sprint has a fixed scope and a fee agreed in the statement of work. We share an indicative fee after the complimentary assessment, once we know the workload.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Do you need access to production?</summary>
            <p>Read-only access is enough for the assessments. Change work goes through your pipelines, approvals and change controls.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Do you do migrations or 24x7 support?</summary>
            <p>Not as part of the sprints. We strengthen Azure environments already in production, within your standards.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Are you a Microsoft partner?</summary>
            <p>Our Microsoft partner registration is in progress. Our engineers hold Microsoft Azure certifications.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
